=== SCREENING TASK: Study 5 ===

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included studies if they were conducted as a randomised controlled trial (RCT), involving adults (≥ 18 years) with a 
diagnosis of HF. We included trials comparing mHealth‐delivered education such as internet and web‐based education 
